<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD 1ST DAY SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD 1ST DAY SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the first day of four-day Sheffield Shield cricket matches on Friday:</p>
<p>In Adelaide: South Australia 216; Victoria 72-1.</p>
<p>In Perth: New South Wales 89 (Bret Mulder five for two); Western Australia 211-7 (Adam Gilchrist 65 not out).</p>
<p>In Hobart: Tasmania 305-6 (Ricky Ponting 159) v Queensland.</p>
